cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Dacă folosești acest studiu, te rog să citezi raportul științific de mai jos."
type: dataset
title: "Test sintaxă prompt: experiment preînregistrat cu linia //Dev_Lab_Op_Mode --creative"
authors:
  - family-names: "Boticiu"
    given-names: "Ovidiu"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
url: "https://github.com/ovidiuboticiu/test-sintaxa-prompt"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ovidiuboticiu/test-sintaxa-prompt"
abstract: "Preregistered experiment testing whether the command-like prompt line //Dev_Lab_Op_Mode --creative affects the creativity of five local language models, compared with no instruction, a plain-language instruction and a placebo line of the same form. 800 generations, blind scoring by two automatic judges, paired permutation tests with Holm correction. Research assisted by AI; without human peer review."
keywords:
  - language models
  - prompt engineering
  - prompt sensitivity
  - preregistration
  - placebo control
  - LLM-as-a-judge
  - permutation test
